OL,3,GNEWSAEpic South America MND challenge
OL,4,Anearly completed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man attempting to run the length of
OL,7,FSouth America to raise awareness of
OL,8,Fmotor neurone disease (MND) is about a
OL,9,Fmonth away from completing his
OL,10,Fchallenge.
OL,12,FMike Humphreys, from Hedon, near Hull,
OL,13,Fset off from Argentina in March and is
OL,14,Fnow about 40 days from reaching the
OL,15,Fnorthern tip of Colombia.
OL,17,FDespite recording a record-breaking 160
OL,18,Fconsecutive 50km runs, he said the
OL,19,Fchallenge was "nothing compared with
OL,20,Fwhat people living with MND face every
OL,21,Fday".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
